### ============================================
### EVENT SERVICE - Pruebas de endpoints (vía API Gateway)
### Puerto interno: 3008 | Prefijo gateway: /api/v1/eventos -> /api/v1/events
### Base de datos: uajs_events (events, event_categories, event_statuses, event_registrations)
### Flujo del evento: draft -> published -> ongoing -> completed | cancelled
### ============================================

@gateway = http://localhost:3000
@direct = http://localhost:3008
@contentType = application/json
@adminEmail = evidencia.qa@uajs.edu
@adminPassword = EvidenciaQA.2026
@campusUuid = e5c4aa33-cbe5-11f1-9d9d-4e6483f921e9
@inscriptionId = 1

### ============================================
### PREREQUISITOS
### 1) SUPERADMIN asignado (ver user-service.http) y LOGIN ejecutado.
### 2) UUID de la sede: SELECT uuid FROM uajs_academic.campuses WHERE is_main = 1;
### 3) Para probar el aforo (maxCapacity = 2) se necesitan al menos 3 usuarios distintos.
### ============================================

### HEALTH CHECK
GET {{direct}}/api/v1/events/health

### LOGIN
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ============================================
### CATEGORÍAS  (event_categories)
### ============================================

### Crear categoría -> 201
# @name createCategoria
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "QA_EVT",
  "name": "Evento QA",
  "colorHex": "#8B5CF6",
  "icon": "flask"
}

### Color inválido -> 400 (regex #RRGGBB)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "QA_BAD",
  "name": "Color inválido",
  "colorHex": "morado"
}

### Listar categorías -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/categorias?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Actualizar categoría -> 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/categorias/{{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Evento QA actualizado"
}

### ============================================
### ESTADOS  (event_statuses, semilla)
### ============================================

GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/estados?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### EVENTOS  (events)
### ============================================

### Crear evento (draft) -> 201
# @name createEvento
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryId": {{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}},
  "campusUuid": "{{campusUuid}}",
  "campusName": "Sede Principal",
  "title": "Jornada de pruebas QA",
  "description": "Evento creado desde pruebas",
  "venue": "Auditorio A",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-20T16:00:00",
  "maxCapacity": 2,
  "cost": 0,
  "requiresRegistration": true,
  "registrationDeadline": "2026-11-18T23:59:00"
}

### Fin anterior al inicio -> 400 (CHECK ends_at > starts_at)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryId": {{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}},
  "campusUuid": "{{campusUuid}}",
  "campusName": "Sede Principal",
  "title": "Fechas inválidas",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T16:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00"
}

### Listar eventos filtrados por categoría -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos?page=1&limit=10&categoryId={{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Obtener evento -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Actualizar evento (draft) -> 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "venue": "Auditorio B",
  "maxCapacity": 2
}

### Publicar (abre inscripciones) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/publicar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### INSCRIPCIONES  (event_registrations)
### UK (event_id, registrant_uuid): una persona no se inscribe dos veces.
### ============================================

### Inscribirse -> 201 (confirmed o waitlisted según aforo)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/inscripciones
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Inscribirse de nuevo con el mismo usuario -> 409
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/inscripciones
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Mis inscripciones -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/inscripciones/mia
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Listado de inscritos (ADMIN) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/inscripciones?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Cancelar mi inscripción -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/inscripciones/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Check-in (ADMIN) -> 200. Reemplazar @inscriptionId por un id confirmado del listado.
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/inscripciones/{{inscriptionId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### TRANSICIONES DEL EVENTO (ADMIN u organizador)
### ============================================

### Iniciar -> 200 (ongoing)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/iniciar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Completar -> 200 (completed)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEvento.response.body.data.id}}/completar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ---- Evento para probar cancelación ----
# @name createEventoCancelar
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryId": {{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}},
  "campusUuid": "{{campusUuid}}",
  "campusName": "Sede Principal",
  "title": "Evento para cancelar",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T14:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-01T16:00:00"
}

### Cancelar evento -> 200 (cancelled, estado final)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEventoCancelar.response.body.data.id}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Eliminar evento de prueba (soft delete) -> 200
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/eventos/{{createEventoCancelar.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### LIMPIEZA
### Los eventos con inscripciones no se borran físicamente. Solo se elimina la categoría
### de prueba si no tiene eventos asociados.
### ============================================
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/eventos/categorias/{{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### VERIFICACIÓN EN BD
### SELECT id, title, status_id, max_capacity FROM uajs_events.events ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 5;
### SELECT event_id, registrant_name, status, attended_at FROM uajs_events.event_registrations ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10;
### ============================================
